# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:23
translate italian tammy5_8fc5eaa3:

    # tm "Hey, [pcname]. I was hoping that you would show up today."
    tm "Ehi, [pcname]. Speravo proprio che ti facessi vivo oggi."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:24
translate italian tammy5_0a01ae52:

    # tm "I have a favor to ask you."
    tm "Ho un favore da chiederti."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:25
translate italian tammy5_1c87ad9d:

    # tm "If you have time this week, could you put in a little extra hours and help me train?"
    tm "Se hai tempo questa settimana, potresti dedicarmi qualche ora in più e aiutarmi ad allenarmi?"

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:26
translate italian tammy5_2a86d305:

    # tm "I have a fight one week from today and I feel like I need some extra sparring to get into the right rhythm and mindset, you know?"
    tm "Ho un incontro tra una settimana e sento di aver bisogno di un po' di sparring in più per entrare nel ritmo e nella mentalità giusti, capisci?"

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:27
translate italian tammy5_6290e18b:

    # tm "I even took evenings off from Java Lava, so I can spend more time up here."
    tm "Ho persino preso qualche serata libera da Java Lava, così posso passare più tempo qui."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:28
translate italian tammy5_73b1ac92:

    # tm "You good with helping me spar?"
    tm "Ti va di aiutarmi con lo sparring?"

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:32
translate italian tammy5_4f9b80dd:

    # tm "That's what I like to hear!"
    tm "È proprio quello che volevo sentire!"

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:33
translate italian tammy5_2425bb2b:

    # tm "Now get your fine ass up in that ring so I can kick it."
    tm "Ora porta quel bel culetto sul ring così posso prendertelo a calci."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:36
translate italian tammy5_0fc31211:

    # tm "Great, let's get started then."
    tm "Fantastico, allora cominciamo."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:39
translate italian tammy5_669580a7:

    # tm "I mean, yeah. It is a lot of work."
    tm "Cioè, sì. È un sacco di lavoro."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:40
translate italian tammy5_265faf02:

    # tm "That's kind of the point though. That's why they call it \"working\" out."
    tm "Ma è proprio questo il punto. Ecco perché si chiama “allenamento”."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:41
translate italian tammy5_1135a251:

    # tm "Anyway, if you're not into it, that's fine. I'll be here though if you want to help."
    tm "Comunque, se non ti va, va bene lo stesso. Io sarò qui se vorrai dare una mano."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:48
translate italian tammyspar0_90680151:

    # "We get into the ring and train hard for three hours straight."
    "Saliamo sul ring e ci alleniamo duramente per tre ore di fila."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:49
translate italian tammyspar0_832dc317:

    # "We practice different positions, practice stand up fighting and movements."
    "Esercitiamo diverse posizioni, combattimento in piedi e movimenti."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:52
translate italian tammyspar0_4d620108:

    # "Until finally, we stop and collapse onto the mat in exhaustion."
    "Finché, alla fine, ci fermiamo e crolliamo sul tappeto sfiniti."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:53
translate italian tammyspar0_535745d5:

    # tm "I think that's enough for now."
    tm "Penso che per ora basti."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:54
translate italian tammyspar0_cb9c08ec:

    # pc "Yeah, I don't know how many more punches I could take."
    pc "Sì, non so quanti altri pugni potrei ancora incassare."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:55
translate italian tammyspar0_67943849:

    # tm "Aw, you're fine."
    tm "Dai, stai bene."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:56
translate italian tammyspar0_22fdacf8:

    # tm "Thanks for sparring with me though. I felt like it really helped."
    tm "Grazie comunque per aver fatto sparring con me. Mi è sembrato davvero utile."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:57
translate italian tammyspar0_0e1da4af:

    # pc "You think you're ready?"
    pc "Pensi di essere pronto?"

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:58
translate italian tammyspar0_e746934f:

    # tm "No, not at all. I need a couple more sessions like this."
    tm "No, per niente. Ho bisogno di un altro paio di sessioni come questa."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:59
translate italian tammyspar0_62a75dd2:

    # tm "Think you could come back sometime during the week to spar more? I'll be here in the evening."
    tm "Pensi di poter tornare qualche volta durante la settimana per fare altro sparring? Sarò qui la sera."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:60
translate italian tammyspar0_61f77a4c:

    # pc "Sure."
    pc "Certo."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:61
translate italian tammyspar0_56e3b38a:

    # tm "Also, I'd love to have you in my corner during the fight."
    tm "Inoltre, mi piacerebbe averti dalla mia parte durante il combattimento."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:62
translate italian tammyspar0_d48d741a:

    # pc "I could do that."
    pc "Potrei farlo."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:63
translate italian tammyspar0_2c10d237:

    # tm "You're kind of good at this stuff you know. You could fight too if you wanted."
    tm "Sei piuttosto bravo in queste cose, lo sai? Potresti combattere anche tu, se volessi."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:64
translate italian tammyspar0_97747303:

    # pc "I'm more of a lover."
    pc "Io sono più un tipo da amore."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:65
translate italian tammyspar0_7c210bb3:

    # tm "Oh is that right?"
    tm "Oh, davvero?"

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:66
translate italian tammyspar0_1fcc5232:

    # tm "Well, you better hit the showers, lover-boy."
    tm "Beh, faresti meglio a fare una doccia, ragazzo romantico."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:67
translate italian tammyspar0_efb5c0de:

    # tm "I'm going to clean up and head home. I'm so tired."
    tm "Vado a darmi una rinfrescata e poi torno a casa. Sono così stanca."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:68
translate italian tammyspar0_f91621b1:

    # tm "Thanks again. It was fun."
    tm "Grazie ancora. È stato divertente."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:71
translate italian tammyspar0_8dc2f452:

    # "She grabs her things and heads to the ladies' showers, while I head to the men's showers."
    "Lei prende le sue cose e va alle docce delle donne, mentre io vado a quelle degli uomini."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:72
translate italian tammyspar0_7d804453:

    # "By the time I'm done, she's already gone."
    "Quando ho finito, se n’è già andata."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:73
translate italian tammyspar0_37a6f478:

    # "It was a fun sparring session though. I'll have to come back and help her spar more before her fight."
    "È stata comunque una sessione di sparring divertente. Dovrò tornare ad aiutarla ad allenarsi di più prima del suo incontro."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:79
translate italian tammyspar0_cc85c375:

    # "Now I need to hurry and get to school."
    "Ora devo sbrigarmi ad andare a scuola."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:87
translate italian tammyspar0_08c4d45a:

    # tm "Did you change your mind? Going to help me train?"
    tm "Hai cambiato idea? Mi aiuterai ad allenarmi?"

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:90
translate italian tammyspar0_72f2c360:

    # tm "I'm glad. Alright, get in the ring so I can beat you up."
    tm "Ne sono felice. Va bene, sali sul ring così posso picchiarti."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:94
translate italian tammyspar0_8399f090:

    # tm "Then why are you bothering me? I have to train."
    tm "Allora perché mi stai dando fastidio? Devo allenarmi."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:103
translate italian tammyspar1_6f0ed0c2:

    # tm "Hey, [pcname]. Ready to help me train?"
    tm "Ehi, [pcname]. Pronto ad aiutarmi ad allenarmi?"

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:104
translate italian tammyspar1_f420071e:

    # pc "Yeah, let's do this."
    pc "Sì, facciamolo."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:107
translate italian tammyspar1_7329cae6:

    # "We get into the ring and train hard for a couple of hours."
    "Saliamo sul ring e ci alleniamo duramente per un paio d’ore."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:108
translate italian tammyspar1_91f2a02c:

    # "She holds back on her punches and kicks, but man after a few hundred of them they really start to hurt."
    "Lei ci va piano con i pugni e i calci, ma cavolo, dopo qualche centinaio di colpi iniziano davvero a far male."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:109
translate italian tammyspar1_cc658c83:

    # "We practice all of the movements, holds, and attacks that she wants to focus on for the fight."
    "Ci esercitiamo su tutti i movimenti, le prese e gli attacchi su cui vuole concentrarsi in vista dell’incontro."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:112
translate italian tammyspar1_3589480a:

    # "And by the end, we are lying in puddles of our own sweat on the mat."
    "E alla fine, siamo distesi sul tappeto in una pozza del nostro stesso sudore."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:113
translate italian tammyspar1_5031ce49:

    # pc "My everything hurts."
    pc "Mi fa male tutto."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:114
translate italian tammyspar1_65be1fb3:

    # tm "Good. That's how I want my opponent to feel."
    tm "Bene. È così che voglio che si senta il mio avversario."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:115
translate italian tammyspar1_209b5ba6:

    # pc "You feeling good about the fight now?"
    pc "Ti senti più tranquillo riguardo all’incontro adesso?"

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:116
translate italian tammyspar1_a82bf39b:

    # tm "Better for sure. I feel like I'm almost in the zone."
    tm "Sicuramente meglio. Mi sento quasi in perfetta sintonia."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:117
translate italian tammyspar1_3b41957d:

    # tm "One more sparring session should do it."
    tm "Un’altra sessione di sparring dovrebbe bastare."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:118
translate italian tammyspar1_de22b3bd:

    # tm "You up for it?"
    tm "Ti va di farlo?"

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:119
translate italian tammyspar1_c4a56d2f:

    # pc "My heart is willing, but my body is bruised."
    pc "Il cuore vorrebbe, ma il corpo è pieno di lividi."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:120
translate italian tammyspar1_e5162b79:

    # tm "Aw, you'll be okay."
    tm "Dai, ce la farai."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:121
translate italian tammyspar1_45351dd0:

    # tm "Might be something good in it for you too."
    tm "Potrebbe esserci qualcosa di buono anche per te."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:122
translate italian tammyspar1_ae871f39:

    # pc "Oh yeah?"
    pc "Ah sì?"

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:123
translate italian tammyspar1_3aaffb9d:

    # tm "After the fight, I could see some good things going your way."
    tm "Dopo l’incontro, potrei vedere delle cose positive in arrivo per te."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:124
translate italian tammyspar1_d93e675a:

    # tm "Assuming I win of course."
    tm "A patto che io vinca, ovviamente."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:125
translate italian tammyspar1_6d5412f5:

    # pc "You'll win. You're a great fighter."
    pc "Vincerai. Sei una grande combattente."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:126
translate italian tammyspar1_ade4dc1d:

    # tm "Thanks."
    tm "Grazie."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:127
translate italian tammyspar1_7c0189e9:

    # tm "I'm going to go clean up. I'll see you next time."
    tm "Vado a darmi una rinfrescata. Ci vediamo la prossima volta."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:128
translate italian tammyspar1_e08706c1:

    # pc "Alright. Bye, Tammy."
    pc "Va bene. Ciao, Tammy."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:131
translate italian tammyspar1_9ae56f74:

    # "She goes to the showers. I clean up too and then leave the gym for the day."
    "Lei va alle docce. Mi rinfresco anch’io e poi lascio la palestra per oggi."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:137
translate italian tammyspar1_cc85c375:

    # "Now I need to hurry and get to school."
    "Ora devo sbrigarmi ad andare a scuola."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:149
translate italian tammyspar2_6f0ed0c2:

    # tm "Hey, [pcname]. Ready to help me train?"
    tm "Ehi, [pcname]. Pronto ad aiutarmi ad allenarmi?"

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:150
translate italian tammyspar2_c640c08c:

    # pc "I'm still sore from last time, but sure."
    pc "Sono ancora indolenzito dall’ultima volta, ma certo."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:152
translate italian tammyspar2_d4e6c2a5:

    # tm "Aw, look at you, toughing it out for me."
    tm "Oh, guardati, che tenace per me."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:153
translate italian tammyspar2_48881b94:

    # pc "I want you to win this thing. Especially if I'm going to be in your corner."
    pc "Voglio che tu vinca questa gara. Soprattutto se sarò nel tuo angolo."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:154
translate italian tammyspar2_bfe1fd8b:

    # tm "Then let's get training. I want to win this thing too."
    tm "Allora mettiamoci ad allenarci. Anch’io voglio vincere questa gara."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:156
translate italian tammyspar2_374feca3:

    # "We go over everything one more time, working even harder than the previous sessions."
    "Ripassiamo tutto un’altra volta, allenandoci ancora più duramente rispetto alle sessioni precedenti."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:157
translate italian tammyspar2_20006225:

    # "By the end, Tammy is moving like a machine, every dodge and punch, every grappling movement, all just instinct and muscle memory."
    "Alla fine, Tammy si muove come una macchina: ogni schivata e ogni pugno, ogni mossa di lotta, tutto è solo istinto e memoria muscolare."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:159
translate italian tammyspar2_4e4c5a23:

    # "Until finally, we can't take any more and we collapse together onto the mat."
    "Finché, alla fine, non ce la facciamo più e crolliamo insieme sul tappeto."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:160
translate italian tammyspar2_a068ca78:

    # tm "I feel really good about this fight now."
    tm "Ora mi sento davvero ottimista riguardo a questo incontro."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:161
translate italian tammyspar2_51b8a4f7:

    # tm "Thanks for all the training. You've been a huge help."
    tm "Grazie per tutto l’allenamento. Mi sei stata di grande aiuto."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:162
translate italian tammyspar2_c46a0b54:

    # pc "Any time."
    pc "Quando vuoi."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:163
translate italian tammyspar2_60bd297a:

    # pc "Actually, I take that back. I'm going to need a little while to recuperate from this."
    pc "Anzi, mi rimangio quello che ho detto. Avrò bisogno di un po’ di tempo per riprendermi da questa."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:164
translate italian tammyspar2_310e49e5:

    # tm "Ha!"
    tm "Ah!"

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:165
translate italian tammyspar2_0fdae2e9:

    # tm "Well the fight is coming up."
    tm "Beh, l’incontro si avvicina."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:166
translate italian tammyspar2_8f754bdf:

    # pc "I'll be there in your corner."
    pc "Sarò lì nel tuo angolo."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:167
translate italian tammyspar2_29a4fcc0:

    # tm "Good. I want you to have a front-row seat to me kicking this chick's ass."
    tm "Bene. Voglio che tu abbia un posto in prima fila per vedermi prendere a calci nel sedere questa ragazza."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:168
translate italian tammyspar2_a2038558:

    # pc "I wouldn't miss it."
    pc "Non me lo perderei per nulla al mondo."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:169
translate italian tammyspar2_e296303f:

    # tm "Thanks again, [pcname]. You're the best."
    tm "Grazie ancora, [pcname]. Sei la migliore."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:170
translate italian tammyspar2_4cac4a98:

    # tm "And I'll be sure to pay you back somehow after the fight."
    tm "E mi assicurerò di ricambiarti in qualche modo dopo l’incontro."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:171
translate italian tammyspar2_6dcf86da:

    # pc "Can't wait."
    pc "Non vedo l’ora."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:172
translate italian tammyspar2_65346d04:

    # tm "Alright, I'm going to head out."
    tm "Va bene, ora esco."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:173
translate italian tammyspar2_1523472a:

    # pc "Me too. See ya Tammy."
    pc "Anch’io. Ci vediamo, Tammy."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:174
translate italian tammyspar2_6471f1e5:

    # tm "Bye, [pcname]."
    tm "Ciao, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:176
translate italian tammyspar2_a23552f4:

    # "We get cleaned up and then leave the gym."
    "Ci sistemiamo un po’ e poi usciamo dalla palestra."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:177
translate italian tammyspar2_89763f7f:

    # "Tammy's fight is coming up this weekend. I can't wait to see her win this thing."
    "L’incontro di Tammy è in programma questo fine settimana. Non vedo l’ora di vederla vincere."

# game/Scenes/Tammy/tammy5.rpy:183
translate italian tammyspar2_cc85c375:

    # "Now I need to hurry and get to school."
    "Ora devo sbrigarmi ad andare a scuola."

